This app bundles or links the following third-party software:

- libmpv-android, MIT licence: https://github.com/hrmasss/libmpv-android, a fork of
  https://github.com/jarnedemeulemeester/libmpv-android.
  Ships native builds of:
  - mpv (https://mpv.io), GPL-2.0-or-later as built.
  - FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org), built with --enable-gpl --enable-version3, so GPL-3.0-or-later.
  - GNU libiconv, LGPL-2.1-or-later, linked statically.
  - libass, FreeType, HarfBuzz, FriBidi, fontconfig, libxml2, libunibreak, uchardet, dav1d,
    libplacebo, mbedTLS, Lua. Each under its own licence, all GPL-3.0 compatible.
  Corresponding source: the fork at tag v1.0.0-player.3, whose buildscripts pin every upstream
  version.

- AndroidX and Jetpack Compose, Apache-2.0.
- Kotlin and kotlinx.coroutines, Apache-2.0.
- smbj (https://github.com/hierynomus/smbj), Apache-2.0, for SMB shares. With its dependencies:
  - asn-one (https://github.com/hierynomus/asn-one), Apache-2.0.
  - Bouncy Castle bcprov (https://www.bouncycastle.org), Bouncy Castle Licence (MIT-style).
  - SLF4J API (https://www.slf4j.org), MIT.
  - MBassador (https://github.com/bennidi/mbassador), MIT.
- Reorderable (sh.calvin.reorderable, drag to reorder playlist rows), Apache-2.0:
  https://github.com/Calvin-LL/Reorderable
- Material Symbols (a few glyphs, as Compose vectors in core/designsystem), Apache-2.0.
  https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
